WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.418
Pfc Portal  ·  Worked example

00:00:00.418 --> 00:00:01.753
Select portal PF01 across the 4.00 m residential opening. The frame is 2.70 m high with fixed bases.

00:00:01.753 --> 00:00:04.166
Review the 200 PFC top beam. Enable automatic column sizing and restrict the catalogue to PFC.

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:05.218
Enter 15 kN as the total service lateral force on the portal. Apply the edit and recalculate.

00:00:05.218 --> 00:00:08.515
The solver selects 150 PFC columns. Preliminary lateral capacity is 16.97 kN for this beam, supports and drift limit.

00:00:08.515 --> 00:00:12.044
Review drift and combined axial force and moment. Verify restraints, connections, anchors and foundations for the project.
